OL,5,G0200 Cornwall: A Year by the Sea
OL,6,     FSummer is hectic for pasty makers,
OL,7,     Fsurf schools and wedding venues
OL,8,     Falike. Staff at the Headland Hotel
OL,9,     Fare dealing with tourists, which
OL,10,     Fbring with them a double edged
OL,11,     Fsword.
OL,12,G0245 Bargain-Loving Brits in the Sun
OL,13,     FBar owners Andy and Matt put on a
OL,14,     FBollywood themed evening. They've
OL,15,     Fhired a dancer to perform, Andy's
OL,16,     Fbusy in the kitchen and Matt's
OL,17,     Flooking after publicity.
