OL,5,G0525 Ben and Holly's Little Kingdom
OL,6,     FIt is harvest day and the elves
OL,7,     Fand fairies enlist Mr Gnome to
OL,8,     Fhelp them pick blackberries. If
OL,9,     Fonly they could stop him from
OL,10,     Feating them all.
OL,11,G0535 Ben and Holly's Little Kingdom
OL,12,     FWhen three baby ladybirds, Amber,
OL,13,     FEmerald and Keith come to stay at
OL,14,     Ftheir uncle Gaston's for the day,
OL,15,     FBen and Holly help him to keep
OL,16,     Fthem entertained.
OL,17,G0545 Ben and Holly's Little Kingdom
OL,18,     FThe bath tap at the Little Castle
OL,19,     Fis dripping, so the elf plumber is
OL,20,     Fcalled. But with King and Queen
OL,21,     FMarigold coming round, there is
OL,22,     Fnot much time.
